ustify-center font-heading font-bold bg-gradient-to-br from-[#9BA0B4] to-[#606478] text-[#101012] w-6 h-6 text-xs animate-tier-pop">C</div><div class="gap-1.5 hidden sm:flex"><span class="text-[10px] px-1.5 py-0.5" style="background-color:#FF8C0020;color:#ffaf4d">Fighter</span></div></div><p class="text-xs text-text-muted mt-1 line-clamp-2">Phoveus&#x27;s durability and kit give them a strong matchup advantage against Paquito throughout the game.</p></div><div class="flex-shrink-0 text-right"><p class="flex items-center justify-end gap-1 text-lg sm:text-xl font-heading font-bold" style="color:#44ff88"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-trending-up w-3.5 h-3.5" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M16 7h6v6"></path><path d="m22 7-8.5 8.5-5-5L2 17"></path></svg>+<!-- -->1.7</p><p class="text-[9px] text-text-muted uppercase hidden sm:block">win rate delta</p></div></div><div class="absolute top-0 left-0 w-3 h-3 border-t border-l border-mlbb-gold/20 pointer-events-none"></div><div class="absolute bottom-0 right-0 w-3 h-3 border-b border-r border-mlbb-gold/20 pointer-events-none"></div></div></div></section><section><div class="mb-4"><div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-1.5"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-swords w-5 h-5 text-text-accent" aria-hidden="true"><polyline points="14.5 17.5 3 6 3 3 6 3 17.5 14.5"></polyline><line x1="13" x2="19" y1="19" y2="13"></line><line x1="16" x2="20" y1="16" y2="20"></line><line x1="19" x2="21" y1="21" y2="19"></line><polyline points="14.5 6.5 18 3 21 3 21 6 17.5 9.5"></polyline><line x1="5" x2="9" y1="14" y2="18"></line><line x1="7" x2="4" y1="17" y2="20"></line><line x1="3" x2="5" y1="19" y2="21"></line></svg><h2 class="text-lg md:text-xl font-heading font-bold text-text-primary">Heroes Paquito<!-- --> <span style="color:#C8AA6E">Counters</span></h2></div><p class="text-xs text-text-muted max-w-2xl">Paquito performs well against these heroes. Consider picking Paquito when you see them on the enemy team.</p></div><div class="space-y-3"><div class="group relative bg-surface-3 border border-mlbb-gold/15 hover:border-mlbb-green/30 transition-all duration-300" style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(12px)"><div class="flex items-center gap-3 p-3 sm:gap-4 sm:p-4"><div class="flex-shrink-0 w-7 sm:w-8 text-center"><span class="text-base sm:text-lg font-heading font-bold text-text-accent">#<!-- -->1</span></div><a class="flex-shrink-0" href="/heroes/natalia"><div class="relative overflow-hidden flex-shrink-0 rounded-full" style="width:48px;height:48px;min-width:48px;background-color:#00AAFF12"><img alt="Natalia hero icon" loading="lazy" width="48" height="48" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="h-full w-full object-cover" style="color:transparent" srcSet="https://wsrv.nl/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fakmweb.youngjoygame.com%2Fweb%2Fsvnres%2Fimg%2Ftest%2Fhomepage_2_2_16_1232_1%2F100_fbb5065b6ff174d1a20ccf5b7f523514.png&amp;w=48&amp;output=webp&amp;q=75&amp;we 1x, https://wsrv.nl/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fakmweb.youngjoygame.com%2Fweb%2Fsvnres%2Fimg%2Ftest%2Fhomepage_2_2_16_1232_1%2F100_fbb5065b6ff174d1a20ccf5b7f523514.png&amp;w=96&amp;output=webp&amp;q=75&amp;we 2x" src="https://wsrv.nl/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fakmweb.youngjoygame.com%2Fweb%2Fsvnres%2Fimg%2Ftest%2Fhomepage_2_2_16_1232_1%2F100_fbb5065b6ff174d1a20ccf5b7f523514.png&amp;w=96&amp;output=webp&amp;q=75&amp;we"/></div></a><div class="min-w-0 flex-1"><div class="flex items-center gap-2 sm:gap-3 flex-wrap"><a class="min-w-0 max-w-full truncate font-heading font-bold text-base sm:text-lg text-text-primary hover:text-text-accent-bright transition-colors" href="/heroes/natalia">Natalia</a><div class="inline-flex items-center justify-center font-heading