ito build, counter, and emblem guide for Mobile Legends. Learn Hunter Strike timing, lane rules, flex items, draft traps, dive angles, and cleaner resets.\",\"inLanguage\":\"en\",\"datePublished\":\"2026-04-20T00:00:00.000Z\",\"dateModified\":\"2026-09-22T00:00:00.000Z\",\"author\":{\"@type\":\"Person\",\"name\":\"Slendertaker\",\"description\":\"Mythic Immortal, Founder \\u0026 Editor of MLBBHub\",\"url\":\"https://mlbbhub.com/authors/slendertaker\",\"image\":\"https://mlbbhub.com/authors/slendertaker.webp\",\"sameAs\":[\"https://github.com/slendertaker\",\"https://x.com/slendertaker7\",\"https://slendertaker.com\"]},\"publisher\":{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"name\":\"MLBBHub\",\"url\":\"https://mlbbhub.com\",\"logo\":{\"@type\":\"ImageObject\",\"url\":\"https://mlbbhub.com/icon-512.png\"}},\"url\":\"https://mlbbhub.com/heroes/paquito\",\"mainEntityOfPage\":{\"@type\":\"WebPage\",\"@id\":\"https://mlbbhub.com/heroes/paquito\"},\"image\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/gms/image/1be4eba1fa94d906a631125ab5fc9c7b.jpg\"}5d:T93d,{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"HowTo\",\"name\":\"How to Build Paquito in Mobile Legends: EXP Sustain Combo\",\"description\":\"Default EXP setup for stable ranked games. Hunter Strike lets Paquito convert a full skill cycle into chase speed, while War Axe plus Queen's Wings replaces old spell-vamp-first paths with current sustain and cooldown value.\",\"totalTime\":\"PT15M\",\"supply\":[{\"@type\":\"HowToSupply\",\"name\":\"Tough Boots\"},{\"@type\":\"HowToSupply\",\"name\":\"Hunter Strike\"},{\"@type\":\"HowToSupply\",\"name\":\"War Axe\"},{\"@type\":\"HowToSupply\",\"name\":\"Queen's Wings\"},{\"@type\":\"HowToSupply\",\"name\":\"Malefic Roar\"},{\"@type\":\"HowToSupply\",\"name\":\"Immortality\"}],\"tool\":[{\"@type\":\"HowToTool\",\"name\":\"Fighter Emblem\"},{\"@type\":\"HowToTool\",\"name\":\"Flicker Battle Spell\"}],\"step\":[{\"@type\":\"HowToStep\",\"position\":1,\"name\":\"Buy Tough Boots\",\"text\":\"Purchase