,\"position\":5,\"name\":\"Buy Malefic Roar\",\"text\":\"Purchase Malefic Roar (2,060 gold) as item 5 in the Jungle Tempo build for Paquito.\",\"url\":\"https://mlbbhub.com/heroes/paquito#build-jungle-tempo\"},{\"@type\":\"HowToStep\",\"position\":6,\"name\":\"Buy Queen's Wings\",\"text\":\"Purchase Queen's Wings (2,250 gold) as item 6 in the Jungle Tempo build for Paquito.\",\"url\":\"https://mlbbhub.com/heroes/paquito#build-jungle-tempo\"}],\"mainEntityOfPage\":{\"@type\":\"WebPage\",\"@id\":\"https://mlbbhub.com/heroes/paquito\"},\"datePublished\":\"2026-04-20T00:00:00.000Z\",\"dateModified\":\"2026-05-13T00:00:00.000Z\",\"author\":{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"name\":\"MLBBHub\",\"url\":\"https://mlbbhub.com\"}}5f:[\"$\",\"script\",\"2\",{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"$64\"}}]\n60:[\"$\",\"$L65\",null,{\"hero\":{\"id\":103,\"name\":\"Paquito\",\"slug\":\"paquito\",\"title\":\"The Heavenly Fist\",\"role\":[\"Fighter\",\"Assassin\"],\"specialty\":[\"Chase\",\"Damage\"],\"lane\":[\"EXP\"],\"tier\":\"B\",\"difficulty\":3,\"releaseYear\":2021,\"stats\":{\"durability\":60,\"offense\":50,\"controlEffect\":40,\"difficulty\":90},\"winRate\":50.38,\"pickRate\":1.51,\"banRate\":34.5,\"counters\":{\"strongAgainst\":[{\"heroSlug\":\"gord\",\"heroName\":\"Gord\",\"advantage\":\"strong\",\"tip\":\"Paquito is a hero with dash and high burst damage, making him strong against squishy heroes without defensive abilities, such as Gord and Layla.\"},{\"heroSlug\":\"layla\",\"heroName\":\"Layla\",\"advantage\":\"strong\",\"tip\":\"Paquito is a hero with dash and high burst damage, making him strong against squishy heroes without defensive abilities, such as Gord and Layla.\"}],\"weakAgainst\":[{\"heroSlug\":\"franco\",\"heroName\":\"Franco\",\"advantage\":\"weak\",\"tip\":\"Paquito is an agile hero, but he is also kind of squishy, which makes him weak against heroes with strong CC abilities. Such as Franco and Kaja.\"},{\"heroSlug\":\"kaja\",\"heroName\":\"Kaja\",\"advantage\":\"weak\",\"tip\":\"Paquito is an agile hero, but he is also kind of squishy, which makes him weak against heroes with strong CC abilities. Such as Franco and Kaja.\"}]},\"splashArt\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/gms/image/1be4eba1fa94d906a631125ab5fc9c7b.jpg\",\"portrait\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_5ab87805b9107b126a3bab64a8a199ad.png\",\"officialMatchups\":[{\"kind\":\"best_ally\",\"heroId\":\"6\",\"heroName\":\"Tigreal\",\"heroSlug\":\"tigreal\",\"icon\":\"https://akmwebstatic.yuanzhanapp.com/web/madmin/image_23a7a603ff9d20074777d52e2eb202f3.jpg\",\"tip\":\"Tigreal, Luo Yi, Angela\"},{\"kind\":\"counters\",\"heroId\":\"40\",\"heroName\":\"Karrie\",\"heroSlug\":\"karrie\",\"icon\":\"https://akmwebstatic.yuanzhanapp.com/web/madmin/image_2ae89c203ad1488fa1af6b7e51dae488.png\",\"tip\":\"Karrie, Sun, Selena\"},{\"kind\":\"countered_by\",\"heroId\":\"73\",\"heroName\":\"Harith\",\"heroSlug\":\"harith\",\"icon\":\"https://akmwebstatic.yuanzhanapp.com/web/madmin/image_6df4352d8f0d6ce429ad308d323c6206.png\",\"tip\":\"Harith, Wanwan, Helcurt\"}],\"skills\":{\"skills\":[{\"name\":\"Champ Stance\",\"type\":\"Passive\",\"description\":\"Paquito gains a stack each time he casts a skill. At 3 stacks, he enters the Champ Stance and enhances his next skill.\\nPaquito's enhanced skills have no cooldown and deal (+2*Hero Level)% extra damage to minions.\\n\\nAfter casting any enhanced skill, Paquito gains 60% Movement Speed and (+2*Hero Level)% Damage Reduction for 1.2s.\",\"descriptionRich\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Paquito gains a stack each time he casts a skill. At 3 stacks, he enters the \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Champ Stance\",\"color\":\"#a6aafb\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" and enhances his next skill.\\nPaquito's enhanced skills have no cooldown and deal (+2*Hero Level)% extra damage to minions.\\n\\nAfter casting any enhanced skill, Paquito gains 60% Movement Speed and (+2*Hero Level)% Damage Reduction for 1.2s.\"}],\"cooldown\":null,\"manaCost\":null,\"icon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_355d974ddddee49aa368a23ce6261325.png\",\"tags\":[\"Buff\",\"Damage\"]},{\"name\":\"Heavy Left Punch\",\"type\":\"Skill 1\",\"description\":\"Paquito throws a punch in the target direction, dealing 210 (+50% Total Physical Attack) Physical Damage to enemies hit and gaining a 150 (+135% Total Physical Attack) shield.\\n\\nChamp Stance: The damage is increased to 350 (+100% Total Physical Attack) Physical Damage, and the shield value is increased to 140% for 2.5s (normal and enhanced shields can stack).\",\"descriptionRich\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Paquito throws a punch in the target direction, dealing 210\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" (+50% Total Physical Attack)\",\"color\":\"#fba51f\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Physical Damage\",\"color\":\"#fb1f1f\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" to enemies hit and gaining a 150\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" (+135% Total Physical Attack)\",\"color\":\"#fba51f\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" shield.\\n\\n\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Champ Stance\",\"color\":\"#a6aafb\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\": The damage is increased to 350\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" (+100% Total Physical Attack)\",\"color\":\"#fba51f\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Physical Damage\",\"color\":\"#fb1f1f\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\", and the shield value is increased to 140% for 2.5s (normal and enhanced shields can stack).\"}],\"cooldown\":\"7s\",\"manaCost\":null,\"icon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_272a8e256ea04a2cc61624913c1a3a0d.png\",\"tags\":[\"AOE\",\"Shield\"]},{\"name\":\"Jab\",\"type\":\"Skill 2\",\"description\":\"Paquito dashes forward and throws a jab, dealing 200 (+165% Total Physical Attack) Physical Damage to enemies in his path and at the destination.\\n\\nChamp Stance: Paquito's jab becomes fiercer, dealing 300 (+210% Total Physical Attack) Physical Damage to enemies hit.\\nThe jab stops upon hitting a hero or creep.\",\"descriptionRich\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Paquito dashes forward and throws a jab, dealing 200\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" (+165% Total Physical Attack)\",\"color\":\"#fba51f\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Physical Damage\",\"color\":\"#fb1f1f\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" to enemies in his path and at the destination.\\n\\n\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Champ Stance\",\"color\":\"#a6aafb\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\": Paquito's jab becomes fiercer, dealing 300\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" (+210% Total Physical Attack)\",\"color\":\"#fba51f\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Physical Damage\",\"color\":\"#fb1f1f\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" to enemies hit.\\nThe jab stops upon hitting a hero or creep.\"}],\"cooldown\":\"7s\",\"manaCost\":null,\"icon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_c25b703eaad4be83ff1d2f9d8376efa6.png\",\"tags\":[\"Burst\",\"Mobility\"]},{\"name\":\"Knockout Strike\",\"type\":\"Ultimate\",\"description\":\"Paquito launches an elbow strike at enemies in the target direction, dealing 250 (+50% Total Physical Attack) Physical Damage and knocking them back to the destination.\\nHe then throws a haymaker, dealing 300 (+90% Total Physical Attack) Physical Damage and slowing them by 75% for 1s, before darting backward.\\n\\nChamp Stance: After knocking enemies back to the destination, Paquito launches an uppercut instead, dealing 400 (+120% Total Physical Attack) Physical Damage and knocking them airborne for 0.5s.\",\"descriptionRich\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Paquito launches an elbow strike at enemies in the target direction, dealing 250\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" (+50% Total Physical Attack)\",\"color\":\"#fba51f\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Physical Damage\",\"color\":\"#fb1f1f\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" and knocking them back to the destination.\\nHe then throws a haymaker, dealing 300\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" (+90% Total Physical Attack)\",\"color\":\"#fba51f\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Physical Damage\",\"color\":\"#fb1f1f\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" and slowing them by 75% for 1s, before darting backward.\\n\\n\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Champ Stance\",\"color\":\"#a6aafb\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\": After knocking enemies back to the destination, Paquito launches an uppercut instead, dealing 400\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" (+120% Total Physical Attack)\",\"color\":\"#fba51f\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Physical Damage\",\"color\":\"#fb1f1f\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" and knocking them airborne for 0.5s.\"}],\"cooldown\":\"15s\",\"manaCost\":null,\"icon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_526a9945a05f076fe151ede742bd3d48.png\",\"tags\":[\"CC\",\"Burst\"]}],\"skillUpgradePriority\":\"3-2-1\"},\"synergies\":[{\"heroSlug\":\"angela\",\"heroName\":\"Angela\",\"synergyScore\":8,\"reason\":\"Paquito works best with support heroes who can buff him, like Angela and Rafaela.\"},{\"heroSlug\":\"rafaela\",\"heroName\":\"Rafaela\",\"synergyScore\":8,\"reason\":\"Paquito works best with support heroes who can buff him, like Angela and Rafaela.\"}],\"combos\":[{\"type\":\"teamfight\",\"title\":\"TEAMFIGHT COMBOS\",\"description\":\"In teamfights, Paquito can use his 2nd Skill to approach the enemy team, then his 1st Skill to deal damage. He should follow up with his Ultimate to knock the enemy back and enter the Champ Stance. He can finish with his enhanced 2nd Skill to deal heavy damage to the enemies.\",\"skillSequence\":[{\"skillId\":10320,\"skillIcon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_c25b703eaad4be83ff1d2f9d8376efa6.png\"},{\"skillId\":10310,\"skillIcon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_272a8e256ea04a2cc61624913c1a3a0d.png\"},{\"skillId\":10330,\"skillIcon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_526a9945a05f076fe151ede742bd3d48.png\"},{\"skillId\":10320,\"skillIcon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_c25b703eaad4be83ff1d2f9d8376efa6.png\"}]},{\"type\":\"laning\",\"title\":\"LANING COMBOS\",\"description\":\"In the laning phase, Paquito can use his 1st Skill to gain a stack for the Champ Stance before using his 2nd Skill to close in on the enemy hero. He can use his 1st Skill again to deal damage and enter the Champ Stance. He should then hit the enemy hero with the enhanced 2nd Skill.\",\"skillSequence\":[{\"skillId\":10310,\"skillIcon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_272a8e256ea04a2cc61624913c1a3a0d.png\"},{\"skillId\":10320,\"skillIcon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_c25b703eaad4be83ff1d2f9d8376efa6.png\"},{\"skillId\":10310,\"skillIcon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_272a8e256ea04a2cc61624913c1a3a0d.png\"},{\"skillId\":10320,\"skillIcon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_c25b703eaad4be83ff1d2f9d8376efa6.png\"}]}],\"metaDescription\":\"Paquito build, counter, and emblem guide for Mobile Legends. Learn Hunter Strike timing, lane rules, flex items, draft traps, dive angles, and cleaner resets.\",\"builds\":[],\"overviewLede\":\"Paquito is not a comfort blind pick anymore. He is a tempo fighter who turns one clean stack cycle into lane control, river priority, and backline pressure, but only when the draft gives him targets he can actually stay on top of. If the enemy comp can deny dashes on reaction, the hero stops looking unfair very quickly.\"},\"serverLocale\":\"en\",\"curatedBuilds\":{\"source\":\"curated\",\"hero\":\"paquito\",\"patch\":\"2.1.67\",\"lastReviewed\":\"2026-05-13\",\"stalePatch\":true,\"currentPatch\":\"2.2.16a\",\"builds\":[{\"slot\":1,\"id\":\"exp-sustain-combo\",\"name\":\"EXP Sustain Combo\",\"roleContext\":\"EXP\",\"items\":[{\"slug\":\"tough-boots\",\"name\":\"Tough Boots\",\"cost\":700,\"fixed\":false},{\"slug\":\"hunter-strike\",\"name\":\"Hunter Strike\",\"cost\":2010,\"fixed\":false},{\"slug\":\"war-axe\",\"name\":\"War Axe\",\"cost\":2100,\"fixed\":false},{\"slug\":\"queens-wings\",\"name\":\"Queen's Wings\",\"cost\":2250,\"fixed\":false},{\"slug\":\"malefic-roar\",\"name\":\"Malefic Roar\",\"cost\":2060,\"fixed\":false},{\"slug\":\"immortality\",\"name\":\"Immortality\",\"cost\":2120,\"fixed\":false}],\"coreItems\":[{\"slug\":\"hunter-strike\",\"name\":\"Hunter Strike\"},{\"slug\":\"war-axe\",\"name\":\"War Axe\"},{\"slug\":\"queens-wings\",\"name\":\"Queen's Wings\"}],\"emblem\":{\"slug\":\"fighter\",\"name\":\"Fighter Emblem\",\"talents\":[{\"slug\":\"firmness\",\"name\":\"Firmness\",\"iconUrl\":\"/images/talents/firmness.png\",\"bucket\":\"standard\"},{\"slug\":\"festival-of-blood\",\"name\":\"Festival of Blood\",\"iconUrl\":\"/images/talents/festival-of-blood.png\",\"bucket\":\"standard\"},{\"slug\":\"brave-smite\",\"name\":\"Brave Smite\",\"iconUrl\":\"/images/talents/brave-smite.png\",\"bucket\":\"core\"}]},\"spell\":{\"slug\":\"flicker\",\"name\":\"Flicker\"},\"blessing\":null,\"flexItems\":[{\"item\":{\"slug\":\"warrior-boots\",\"name\":\"Warrior Boots\"},\"replace\":{\"slug\":\"tough-boots\",\"name\":\"Tough Boots\"},\"trigger\":\"Use against physical EXP lanes with light crowd control where Valor stacks decide the first two waves.\"},{\"item\":{\"slug\":\"brute-force-breastplate\",\"name\":\"Brute Force Breastplate\"},\"replace\":{\"slug\":\"malefic-roar\",\"name\":\"Malefic Roar\"},\"trigger\":\"Use when you are starting fights often and need stacking movement speed, control-duration reduction, and durability before armor penetration.\"},{\"item\":{\"slug\":\"sea-halberd\",\"name\":\"Sea Halberd\"},\"replace\":{\"slug\":\"malefic-roar\",\"name\":\"Malefic Roar\"},\"trigger\":\"Use against shield or regen-heavy front lines before they stack enough Physical Defense to make Malefic Roar mandatory.\"},{\"item\":{\"slug\":\"oracle\",\"name\":\"Oracle\"},\"replace\":{\"slug\":\"immortality\",\"name\":\"Immortality\"},\"trigger\":\"Use when repeated skirmishes matter more than one final revive and your stacked Heavy Left Punch shields decide the trade.\"}],\"notes\":\"Default EXP setup for stable ranked games. Hunter Strike lets Paquito convert a full skill cycle into chase speed, while War Axe plus Queen's Wings replaces old spell-vamp-first paths with current sustain and cooldown value.\",\"totalCost\":11240,\"statLines\":[{\"key\":\"physatk\",\"labelKey\":\"common.stats.physicalAttack\",\"unit\":\"flat\",\"group\":\"offensive\",\"value\":175,\"sources\":[\"Hunter Strike\",\"War Axe\",\"Malefic Roar\"]},{\"key\":\"adaptiveatk\",\"labelKey\":\"common.stats.adaptiveAttack\",\"unit\":\"flat\",\"group\":\"offensive\",\"value\":40,\"sources\":[\"Queen's Wings\"]},{\"key\":\"physpenFlat\",\"labelKey\":\"common.stats.physicalPenetration\",\"unit\":\"flat\",\"group\":\"offensive\",\"value\":15,\"sources\":[\"Hunter Strike\"]},{\"key\":\"spellvamp\",\"labelKey\":\"common.stats.spellVamp\",\"unit\":\"percent\",\"group\":\"offensive\",\"value\":18,\"sources\":[\"War Axe\",\"Queen's Wings\"]},{\"key\":\"hp\",\"labelKey\":\"common.stats.hp\",\"unit\":\"flat\",\"group\":\"defensive\",\"value\":1800,\"sources\":[\"War Axe\",\"Queen's Wings\",\"Immortality\"]},{\"key\":\"physdefense\",\"labelKey\":\"common.stats.physicalDefense\",\"unit\":\"flat\",\"group\":\"defensive\",\"value\":15,\"sources\":[\"Immortality\"]},{\"key\":\"magicdefense\",\"labelKey\":\"common.stats.magicDefense\",\"unit\":\"flat\",\"group\":\"defensive\",\"value\":18,\"sources\":[\"Tough Boots\"]},{\"key\":\"movespeed\",\"labelKey\":\"common.stats.movementSpeed\",\"unit\":\"flat\",\"group\":\"utility\",\"value\":40,\"sources\":[\"Tough Boots\"]},{\"key\":\"cdreduction\",\"labelKey\":\"common.stats.cooldownReduction\",\"unit\":\"percent\",\"group\":\"utility\",\"value\":30,\"sources\":[\"Hunter Strike\",\"War Axe\",\"Queen's Wings\"]}],\"conflicts\":[],\"simulatorUrl\":\"/build-simulator?hero=paquito\u0026items=tough-boots%2Chunter-strike%2Cwar-axe%2Cqueens-wings%2Cmalefic-roar%2Cimmortality\u0026spell=flicker\u0026emblem=fighter\u0026talents=firmness%2Cfestival-of-blood%2Cbrave-smite\u0026flex=warrior-boots.tough-boots%2Cbrute-force-breastplate.malefic-roar%2Csea-halberd.malefic-roar%2Coracle.immortality\"},{\"slot\":2,\"id\":\"exp-burst-pickoff\",\"name\":\"EXP Burst Pickoff\",\"roleContext\":\"EXP\",\"items\":[{\"slug\":\"tough-boots\",\"name\":\"Tough Boots\",\"cost\":700,\"fixed\":false},{\"slug\":\"hunter-strike\",\"name\":\"Hunter Strike\",\"cost\":2010,\"fixed\":false},{\"slug\":\"malefic-roar\",\"name\":\"Malefic Roar\",\"cost\":2060,\"fixed\":false},{\"slug\":\"blade-of-the-heptaseas\",\"name\":\"Blade of the Heptaseas\",\"cost\":1950,\"fixed\":false},{\"slug\":\"blade-of-despair\",\"name\":\"Blade of Despair\",\"cost\":3010,\"fixed\":false},{\"slug\":\"immortality\",\"name\":\"Immortality\",\"cost\":2120,\"fixed\":false}],\"coreItems\":[{\"slug\":\"hunter-strike\",\"name\":\"Hunter Strike\"},{\"slug\":\"malefic-roar\",\"name\":\"Malefic Roar\"},{\"slug\":\"blade-of-the-heptaseas\",\"name\":\"Blade of the Heptaseas\"}],\"emblem\":{\"slug\":\"assassin\",\"name\":\"Assassin Emblem\",\"talents\":[{\"slug\":\"rupture\",\"name\":\"Rupture\",\"iconUrl\":\"/images/talents/rupture.png\",\"bucket\":\"standard\"},{\"slug\":\"master-assassin\",\"name\":\"Master Assassin\",\"iconUrl\":\"/images/talents/master-assassin.png\",\"bucket\":\"standard\"},{\"slug\":\"lethal-ignition\",\"name\":\"Lethal Ignition\",\"iconUrl\":\"/images/talents/lethal-ignition.png\",\"bucket\":\"core\"}]},\"spell\":{\"slug\":\"flicker\",\"name\":\"Flicker\"},\"blessing\":null,\"flexItems\":[{\"item\":{\"slug\":\"warrior-boots\",\"name\":\"Warrior Boots\"},\"replace\":{\"slug\":\"tough-boots\",\"name\":\"Tough Boots\"},\"trigger\":\"Use when the enemy draft has physical lane pressure but no reliable chain control to punish the all-in.\"},{\"item\":{\"slug\":\"queens-wings\",\"name\":\"Queen's Wings\"},\"replace\":{\"slug\":\"blade-of-despair\",\"name\":\"Blade of Despair\"},\"trigger\":\"Use when the first dive is being answered by burst damage and you need Demonize plus spell vamp to finish the combo.\"},{\"item\":{\"slug\":\"brute-force-breastplate\",\"name\":\"Brute Force Breastplate\"},\"replace\":{\"slug\":\"blade-of-despair\",\"name\":\"Blade of Despair\"},\"trigger\":\"Use when you still need to play pickoff angles but cannot afford to be stopped by the first control chain.\"},{\"item\":{\"slug\":\"sea-halberd\",\"name\":\"Sea Halberd\"},\"replace\":{\"slug\":\"malefic-roar\",\"name\":\"Malefic Roar\"},\"trigger\":\"Use when anti-heal is required against Estes, Angela, Esmeralda, or sustain fighters before armor stacking becomes the main problem.\"}],\"notes\":\"High-damage EXP setup for drafts where Paquito can isolate a side target. Assassin emblem, Heptaseas, and Blade of Despair reward clean fog entries, but the build loses value when he has to front-line.\",\"totalCost\":11850,\"statLines\":[{\"key\":\"physatk\",\"labelKey\":\"common.stats.physicalAttack\",\"unit\":\"flat\",\"group\":\"offensive\",\"value\":370,\"sources\":[\"Hunter Strike\",\"Malefic Roar\",\"Blade of the Heptaseas\",\"Blade of Despair\"]},{\"key\":\"physpenFlat\",\"labelKey\":\"common.stats.physicalPenetration\",\"unit\":\"flat\",\"group\":\"offensive\",\"value\":30,\"sources\":[\"Hunter Strike\",\"Blad